OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Society 'much needed
OL,4,Aescapism', actor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHelen George, star of Call the Midwife,
OL,7,Fis part of a new production of High
OL,8,FSociety coming to stages in Kent and
OL,9,FSussex.
OL,11,FGeorge, who plays Tracy Lord, said Cole
OL,12,FPorter's romantic comedy - with lavish
OL,13,Fsets, costumes and musical numbers - is
OL,14,Fpromising to give audiences a welcome
OL,15,Fdiversion when it plays at the Marlowe
OL,16,FTheatre in Canterbury and the Congress
OL,17,FTheatre in Eastbourne.
OL,19,F"It's such a different world from our
OL,20,Flife today and we always need escapism,
OL,21,Fparticularly at the moment," George
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
